      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 301542353,
      "version": 281,
      "versionNonce": 80961585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774774645238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "策略迭代：\n    1. 针对固定的策略 π ，拟合该策略真实的价值函数 V\n    2. 基于目前计算出的 V , 找出更优策略 π‘",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "策略迭代：\n    1. 针对固定的策略 π ，拟合该策略真实的价值函数 V\n    2. 基于目前计算出的 V , 找出更优策略 π‘",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-v3mhVRJA-lArF5im0Y-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -371.01159172113495,
      "y": 1783.7340617067093,
      "width": 496.01995849609375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0v",
