      "text": "学习算法：如何评估当前当前节点好坏",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "学习算法：如何评估当前当前节点好坏",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RfMo7YgbiITNS2N5VsDGJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -328.939129592016,
      "y": 2263.0814529597683,
      "width": 452,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 523453855,
      "version": 179,
      "versionNonce": 1263986047,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774769038486,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "时序差分学习(TD):\n    根据当前的观察与下一步的预测，更新当前步\n    骤的评分，影响下一次智能体遇到步骤时的选择",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "时序差分学习(TD):\n    根据当前的观察与下一步的预测，更新当前步\n    骤的评分，影响下一次智能体遇到步骤时的选择",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EM4sI2NA3eZrkPfRStpzF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -290.7750129674678,
      "y": 2352.036410566507,
      "width": 419.47998046875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 276467601,
