          "id": "nZygNyxFnoQwcWukZfB-c",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1774769592425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SARSA：同策略\n    1. 使用ε-贪婪算法进行节点选择\n    2. 根据选择节点的回报更新当前节点的价值",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SARSA：同策略\n    1. 使用ε-贪婪算法进行节点选择\n    2. 根据选择节点的回报更新当前节点的价值",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4FQJUdbJ1yDjW8XlAk5bo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -289.68480994824915,
