        }
      ],
      "updated": 1774775236313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DQN：神经网络版 Q-learning\n    1. 经验回放：采样放入缓冲区，训练时随机采样，使数据服从独立同分布\n    2. 一个网络用于训练，一个网络用于预测，定期从训练网络复制权重，加强稳定性",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DQN：神经网络版 Q-learning\n    1. 经验回放：采样放入缓冲区，训练时随机采样，使数据服从独立同分布\n    2. 一个网络用于训练，一个网络用于预测，定期从训练网络复制权重，加强稳定性",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GVcH0qqy6YaDt8JSJiUnK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 559.057520631258,
      "y": 2578.949374029693,
      "width": 472,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55612657,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 587616017,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "qOhkB-SfnIjbIgUeLy1X_",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1774773480784,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Double DQN:：\n    在训练网络时更新选取累计奖励最大的下一步节点\n    防止 Q 因误差被高估",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Double DQN:：\n    在训练网络时更新选取累计奖励最大的下一步节点\n    防止 Q 因误差被高估",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
